REFINED THE SAME DAY, by the band itself: a v1 run failed at 93.5 ms maxAbs, because the file's zero
was stamped at recorder.start() while a canvas capture stream only produces a frame when the canvas is
PAINTED — up to a frame of nothing in between, and every copied packet a frame early. Dated from the
first paint at or after start() now (start() is the fallback). v1 instant, three cold runs: 44.3 /
